# Keep training/demo data, evaluation datasets and frozen results, probe weights,
# training scripts, frontend/backend code, SDKs and integration examples versioned.
# Do not ignore scripts/, train/, data/, evaluation/, results/ or probe/.
# In particular, test.jsonl and *_test_predictions.jsonl are data, not test code.

